# run3-r4-cards-v2-slim-tracks: Native generator-particle jet-pT response, misses/fakes and per-jet covariance.
# Preparation, not a production submission or a physics validation.
# Run from repository root; all payload paths are repository-relative.
# Report 40-80,80-120,120-160 GeV; both n=1,2; strict pair pT>2.
# Stored activity is not an event cut or percentile certification.
# Apply existing synchronized physical-event folds externally; filenames do not create independent halves.
# truthGuard5 reproduces the current support; truthGuard10 is a sensitivity test, not an approved replacement.
# Response production is not unfolding or a selected iteration count.
DataType 10
McCorrelationType 1
MatchJets 0
TriggerSelection 0
FilledHistograms 211
JetType 1
JetAxis 1
JetEtaCut 1.6
MinJetPtCut 40
MaxJetPtCut 5020
CutBadPhi 0
CutWithEtaCM 0
MinMaxTrackPtFraction 0.01
MaxMaxTrackPtFraction 0.98
JetUncertainty 0
Run3JetID 1
Run3JetIDTable MiniPOG20261108
Run3JetQA 1
Run3JEC 1
ApplyJetVeto 1
JetVetoMapFile jetVetoMaps/OO2025/Summer24Prompt25_RunCDEFG.root
JetVetoMapHistogram jetvetomap_all
JetVetoPtConvention stored
JetVetoInputMinPt 15
Run3TrackSelection Nominal
TrackEtaCut 2.4
MinTrackPtCut 2
MaxTrackPtCut 500
MaxTrackPtRelativeError 0.1
VertexMaxDistance 3
SubeventCut 2
TrackEfficiencyVariation 0
JetPtWeight 0
DisableTrackPairEfficiencyCorrection 1
ZVertexCut 15
LowPtHatCut -15
HighPtHatCut 5020
MultiplicityMode 0
JetRadius 0.4
WeightExponent 1 2
SmearDeltaR 0
SmearEnergyWeight 0
JetPtBinEdgesEEC 5 10 20 40 80 120 160 200 300 500 5020
TrackPtBinEdgesEEC 0.5 1 1.5 2 2.5 3 3.5 4 300
SkipCovarianceMatrix 0
MinJetPtUnfoldingReco 40
MinJetPtUnfoldingTruth 10
CentralityBinEdges -1 100
TrackPtBinEdges 0.7 1 2 3 4 8 12 300
PtHatBinEdges 0 30 50 80 120 170 220 280 370 460
BackgroundMethods 0
MegaSkimMixing 0
EventMatchForMixing 0
BinnedMixing 0
VzMixingBins -0.5 1
HiBinMixingBins -0.5 1
HFEnergyMixingBins 0 1
MultiplicityMixingBins -0.5 5
HFEnergyShift 0
DebugLevel 0
MaxEventsPerFile 0
ChannelRadiusCode 4
MinPairTrackPt 2
FirstUnfoldedJetPtBin 3
LastUnfoldedJetPtBin 5
